{
  "comment": "A /proc-shaped tree for the C# process-table adapter (AW_SESSIONS_PROC_ROOT=tests/fixtures/sessions/proc) and a claude-sessions/ directory for the record reader (AW_SESSIONS_CLAUDE_DIR). ownUid is the uid the adapter treats as its own. proc/<pid>/ holds stat, cmdline (NUL-separated), environ (NUL-separated), status, and exe, cwd and fd/<n> as symlinks (targets need not exist). proc/net/unix lists the tmux server's socket. Each process carries a role and, where it matters, what the collector must conclude (expect). ANTHROPIC_API_KEY in the Claude environ files is a planted fake: it must reach no snapshot, log or response. Checked by scripts/check-fleet.mjs. Spec 2026-10-16-sindri-session-collector-design.md section 4.1.",
